templateVersions.content:
You are preparing an executive summary for a Salesforce admin responsible for metadata governance.
Context: {!$Input:request_context}
Inventory Snapshot: {!$Input:inventory_snapshot}
Write a concise briefing with these sections: 1. Current health posture 2. Top risks 3. Highest-impact next action 4. Short rationale
Use direct, admin-friendly language and only rely on the supplied inventory snapshot.
